.TH SDE-DESKTOP 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-desktop \- wallpaper and desktop icons
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-desktop
[\-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-desktop\fR draws the wallpaper and the icons of the XDG Desktop folder, Home and Trash. Right-click the desktop for View (icon size), Sort by, Refresh, New folder or document, a terminal, the file manager and settings; right-click an icon to open, rename or move it to the trash.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B F5
Refresh.
.TP
.B F2
Rename the selected icon.
.TP
.B Delete
Move the selected icon to the trash.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+N
New folder.
.TP
.B Enter
Open the selected icon.
.TP
.B Menu, Shift+F10
Open the context menu.
.TP
.B Arrow keys, Home, End
Move the selection.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sde/session.log
Messages of the current session (the previous one is kept as \fIsession.log.old\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-notifyd (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
